Some definitions in this directory and in the driver's tests in
kernel/tests/graphics are re-declared from NVIDIA's open GPU kernel modules at
release 535.183.01 (https://github.com/NVIDIA/open-gpu-kernel-modules), and
each file holding one says so in its first line. The EDID parser
(kernel/drivers/graphics/edid.h and edid.cpp) and its tests
(kernel/tests/graphics/edid.test.cpp) restate rules from them too. Below are
the files of the open kernel modules these definitions and rules come from,
what each gives, and its copyright line.

